menu "Flip-dot controller"

    config FLIPDOT_UART_NUM
        int "UART port for the display"
        range 1 2
        default 2
        help
            UART0 is the USB console. 1 and 2 are free.

    config FLIPDOT_TX_GPIO
        int "TX GPIO (to the MAX3490 DI)"
        default 17
        help
            Avoid the strapping pins GPIO0, 2, 12 and 15. GPIO16/17 are the
            UART2 defaults and are free on a WROOM devkit, but they are wired
            to PSRAM on WROVER modules -- use 32/33 there.

    config FLIPDOT_RX_GPIO
        int "RX GPIO (from the MAX3490 RO)"
        default 16

    config FLIPDOT_ADDRESS
        int "Display address (0-31)"
        range 0 31
        default 1
        help
            This unit was found at address 1. Overridable from the web UI.

    config FLIPDOT_BAUD
        int "Baud rate"
        default 1200

    config FLIPDOT_SETTLE_MS
        int "Settle time after a repaint, milliseconds"
        default 3000
        help
            The dots are mechanical. This also bounds the global repaint rate,
            so no mode can flip the panel faster than this.

endmenu
